===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|nose}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nosu}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*nosu}}, variant of {{m|gem-pro|*nasō}}, old dual from {{der|en|ine-pro|*néh₂s-}} ~ {{m|ine-pro|*nh₂es-||nose, nostril}} 

See also {{cog|stq|Noose}}, {{cog|fy|noas}}, {{cog|nl|neus}}, {{cog|sv|nos|}}, {{cog|no|nos||snout}}, {{cog|nds-de||Nees, Nes, Näs}}, {{cog|de|Nase}}, {{cog|sv|näsa}}, {{cog|no|nese}}, {{cog|da|næse||nose}}; also {{cog|la|nāris||nostril}}, {{m|la|nāsus||nose}}, {{cog|lt|nósis}}, {{cog|ru|нос}}, {{cog|sa|नासा|tr=nā́sā||nostrils}}.

